cJSON Library
=============

Version: 1.7.19 (CJSON_VERSION_* in cJSON.h)
Source: https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON
License: MIT

This library is vendored into VICE for JSON parsing/generation in the MCP server.

cJSON is a ultra-lightweight, portable, single-file JSON parser/generator
written in ANSI C.

Files:
- src/lib/cjson/cJSON.c - Implementation; this is the copy libmcp.a compiles
  (see Makefile.am)
- src/lib/cjson/cJSON.h - Header
- cJSON.c, cJSON.h in this directory - byte-identical copies. The MCP sources
  include "cJSON.h" with quotes, so the header found here is the one they use;
  cJSON.c here is not built.

The library is used as-is without modifications.
